  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\n** (2x)/(x+2)+ (1)/(2x+4)- (12-x)/(2x²+4x)=a+(b)/(x)**\n\n⇒ (2x)/(x+2)+ (1)/(2(x+2))- (12-x)/(2x(x+2))=a+(b)/(x)\n\n⇒ (1)/((x+2))[2x+ (1)/(2)- (12-x)/(2x)]=a+(b)/(x)\n\n⇒ (1)/((x+2))[(4x²+x-12+x)/(2x)]=a+(b)/(x)\n\n⇒ (1)/((x+2))[(4x²+2x-12)/(2x)]=a+(b)/(x)\n\n⇒ (1)/((x+2))[(2x²+x-6)/(x)]=a+(b)/(x)\n\n⇒ (2x²+4x-3x-6)/(x(x+2))=a+(b)/(x)\n\n⇒ (2x(x+2)-3(x+2))/(x(x+2))=a+(b)/(x)\n\n⇒ ((2x-3)(x+2))/(x(x+2))=a+(b)/(x)\n\n⇒ ((2x-3))/(x)=a+(b)/(x)\n\n⇒ 2+((-3))/(x)=a+(b)/(x)\n\nOn comparing both sides, we get\n\n⇒ a = 2 and b = -3\n\n⇒ ab = 2 × (-3)\n\n⇒ ab = -6\n\n**∴ Option 2 is the correct answer.**",
